# Vector 3 - READ RECORD response, long-form length (81 8C = 140 octets)
# Published EMV / OpenSCDP sample. Synthetic; no live cardholder data.
# The bytes are the oracle: some published summaries of this record cite a different PAN/expiry.
#   5A  PAN     = 5570295626678085  (masked by default; full value only under reveal())
#   5F24 expiry = 20 11 30          (2020-11-30)
#   5F25 effect = 16 03 01          (2016-03-01)
#   5F28 country/9F42 currency = 0643
#   8C CDOL1, 8D CDOL2 (DOLs, opaque here), 8E CVM List, 9F0D/0E/0F IACs (TVR-shaped bit fields).
#   9F4A SDA Tag List is not yet in the dictionary -> resolves Unknown.
